---
permalink: /index.html
pageType: home
useGeneralFaqs: true
faqLimit: 6
title: "We Buy Houses in Gaston & Cleveland County NC | Cash Offer in 24 Hours"
description: "Sell your house fast for cash in Gastonia, Shelby, Kings Mountain and across Gaston & Cleveland County NC. Any condition, no repairs, no commission, no closing costs. Written offer in 24 hours."
breadcrumbs:
  - name: "Home"
    url: "/"
---
{% from "components/lead-form.njk" import leadForm with context %}
{% import "components/blocks.njk" as b with context %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero__grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Gaston &middot; Cleveland &middot; Lincoln County, NC</p>
      <h1>We buy houses in Gaston &amp; Cleveland County. Any condition, any situation.</h1>
      <p class="hero__sub">
        A written cash offer within {{ site.offerWindowHours }} hours. You pick the closing date.
        No repairs, no commission, no closing costs, and no obligation to take it.
      </p>
      <ul class="hero__points">
        <li>Don't fix anything &mdash; we buy exactly as the house stands</li>
        <li>Don't clean it out &mdash; take what you want, leave the rest</li>
        <li>No commission and no closing costs, ever</li>
        <li>Close in {{ site.closeDaysMin }}&ndash;{{ site.closeDaysMax }} days, or whenever suits you</li>
        <li>We don't re-trade you on condition &mdash; the number doesn't move after you sign</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="hero__trust">
        Rather just talk? Call
        <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneRaw }}" style="color:#fff"><strong>{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</strong></a>
        or text <a href="sms:{{ site.smsRaw }}" style="color:#fff"><strong>{{ site.smsDisplay }}</strong></a>.
        {{ site.businessHours }}.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      {{ leadForm("hero-form", "hero", null, null, "What's your house worth to us?", "Start with the address. Written offer within " + site.offerWindowHours + " hours.", true) }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="trust-bar">
  <div class="wrap">
    <ul>
      <li>Written offers, not verbal estimates</li>
      <li>We walk every property ourselves</li>
      <li>Closed through a North Carolina attorney</li>
      <li>We'll tell you when listing beats selling to us</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    <div class="answer-box">
      <p>
        <strong>How does selling a house for cash work?</strong> You tell us the address and
        what's going on. We walk the property in person, then send a written offer within
        {{ site.offerWindowHours }} hours with the math behind it. If you accept, a North
        Carolina closing attorney handles title and closing, usually in
        {{ site.closeDaysMin }} to {{ site.closeDaysMax }} days. You make no repairs, pay no
        commission, and pay no closing costs.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Why people call us</h2>
    <p class="lead mt-4 mb-6">
      Almost nobody sells to a cash buyer because they want top dollar. They sell because
      something else matters more &mdash; a deadline, a house they can't fix, a situation
      they need to be done with.
    </p>
    {{ b.situationGrid() }}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    <h2 class="mb-6">How it works</h2>
    {{ b.howItWorks() }}
    <p class="mt-6"><a href="/how-it-works/">See the whole process in detail &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    <h2 class="mb-5">The one thing we won't do to you</h2>
    {{ b.noRetradePromise() }}
    {{ b.twoNumberPromise() }}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    <h2 class="mb-5">What we'll put in writing</h2>
    {{ b.guarantee() }}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--warm">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    <h2 class="mb-5">Cash offer vs. listing with an agent</h2>
    {{ b.comparison() }}
    {{ b.valueStack() }}
    <p class="mt-5"><a href="/compare/">The full comparison, including iBuyers &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="mb-5">Houses we've bought</h2>
    {{ b.caseStudies() }}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="mb-5">What sellers say</h2>
    {{ b.testimonials() }}
    <p class="mt-6"><a href="/reviews/">Read more &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="mb-4">Where we buy houses</h2>
    <p class="lead mb-5">
      We work Gaston, Cleveland, and Lincoln counties, and we keep the radius tight on
      purpose. We walk every property ourselves, which is not something you can do well
      across half a state.
    </p>
    <ul class="pill-links">
      {% for c in cities %}
      <li><a href="/sell-my-house-fast-{{ c.slug }}-nc/">{{ c.name }}, NC</a></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-5"><a href="/service-areas/">Not on the list? We probably still buy there &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    <h2 class="mb-5">Common questions</h2>
    {{ b.faqList(faqItems) }}
    <p class="mt-6"><a href="/faq/">Every question we get asked &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

{{ b.ctaBand("Find out what your house is worth to us", "Start with the address. A written offer within " + site.offerWindowHours + " hours, no obligation, and we'll tell you honestly if listing would net you more.") }}

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    {{ leadForm("bottom-form", "full") }}
  </div>
</section>
